      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It also appears that the TCP/JSON service must also be bound to NULL (All interfaces) or to the LAN interface VRChat is defaulting to. So when I broadcast a TCP/JSON service via mDNS with an A record of 127.0.0.1 VRChat does not respond at all. However changing that A record to point to my LAN address yields an instant response to my TCP/JSON service.",
